# Public-vs-local repository contents boundary (REPO-LAYOUT 0.12 rule 8, owner 2026-11-27, FILLER-0071):
# agent instructions, agent config, portfolio stamps, contract pointers, the document registry, the release
# ledger and harness glue stay local; the public remote carries source, site, public docs, CI and channel
# manifests only. The files below stay on disk, untracked (git rm --cached, no history rewrite).
